    <h1>AI Policy</h1>
    <p class="ld-sub">Our approach to artificial intelligence: a tool that supports human creativity, never a replacement for it.</p>
    <div class="ld-meta">Last updated: June 2026</div>
  </header>
  <article class="ld-body">
<section><h2><span class="n">01</span>AI supports our work</h2><p>We use artificial intelligence to accelerate research, explore directions and remove friction from production. It is a tool that amplifies our team &mdash; not a shortcut around craft.</p></section>
<section><h2><span class="n">02</span>Human creativity remains central</h2><p>Strategy, taste and creative judgment come from people. Every concept is shaped, directed and decided by our specialists. AI never replaces strategic thinking.</p></section>
<section><h2><span class="n">03</span>Every deliverable is reviewed</h2><p>Work touched by AI is always reviewed by experienced specialists before it reaches a client. The standard is the same as for any BaseCamp Studio&reg; deliverable: nothing ships unless it meets it.</p></section>
<section><h2><span class="n">04</span>Responsible and protected use</h2><p>We use AI responsibly and protect client information at every step. Confidential client material is not used to train external models, and sensitive data is handled according to our <a class="inl" href="client-confidentiality">confidentiality</a> and <a class="inl" href="privacy-policy">privacy</a> commitments.</p></section>
  </article>
